00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:39.910
I don't know.

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:49.660
I've overturned the BRA.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.660
Pro hero.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.660
Okay.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:59.930
Lois?

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.620
Lois, I'm home.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:11.060
Now, I still think newspaper is the number one way to spread the word,

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:14.060
