00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.060
I just single-handedly swayed 30 more votes in our favor.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.060
I love your enthusiasm, but I don't have much time for politics.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.060
Do you have time for your mom?

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:25.060
Because a certain senator has been working overtime to overturn the VRA.

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:31.060
Her cross-country campaigning has raised enough hero support to force a national vote.

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.060
And I appreciate everything that she's done.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:37.060
Lois, the votes tomorrow.

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:40.060
Clark, you don't give up on the game when there are seconds left on the clock.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:43.060
I'm still out there saving people, Lois, whether they want me around or not.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.060
You need to see something.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:51.389
A small motorcade has pulled up behind the podium.

00:06:51.389 --> 00:06:54.389
