00:06:54.389 --> 00:06:57.389
A major opponent of the VRA...

00:06:57.389 --> 00:07:01.389
Clark, you were so focused on flying under the radar that you lost sight of the skyline.

00:07:01.389 --> 00:07:03.389
A lot of people still believe in heroes.

00:07:03.389 --> 00:07:05.389
They just need something to give them the courage to come out and fight.

00:07:05.389 --> 00:07:12.740
encouraged to come out and fight.

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.740
Or someone.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:28.189
These are difficult times.

00:07:28.189 --> 00:07:31.189
With heroes being painted as criminals.

00:07:31.189 --> 00:07:33.189
It's easy to lose hope.

00:07:33.189 --> 00:07:36.189
But if we don't speak up now, then when?

00:07:36.189 --> 00:07:39.980
My father always said,

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:42.980
life only asks of you what you can handle.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.980
Sometimes we can't do it on our own.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.980
That's why we need to join together in this crusade like a family.

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:52.980
So that our united strength shines through the darkness like a beacon.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:59.980
us like a beacon, inspiring others to find their voices.

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.980
None of us is born to hate.

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:05.980
We're taught to.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:09.980
That's why we need heroes to remind us that we are all meant

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:12.980
to fight for truth and justice.

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:15.980
To take a stand against fear and hate.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.980
To go to the polls tomorrow and vote down.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:24.120
The vote down the VRA!

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.329
Vote!

00:08:27.329 --> 00:08:27.829
See?

00:08:27.829 --> 00:08:28.829
There's still hope.

00:08:28.829 --> 00:08:50.379
Sounded like gunshots.

00:08:50.379 --> 00:08:51.379
I'm your son.

00:08:51.379 --> 00:08:52.379
Yes, Mr. Ken.

00:08:52.379 --> 00:08:59.340
Thank you for your concern, Lois.

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.340
Oh, hold on a second.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.340
Hi, sweetheart.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.750
Hi.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:05.750
Hi.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:11.090
I know Clark does have a way of leaving abruptly.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.090
Um, I'm gonna stop by the farm later.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:15.090
Bye-bye.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.090
You're okay.

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:17.090
I'm fine.

