00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.090
Why didn't you tell me you were in town?

00:09:22.090 --> 00:09:23.090
I could have protected you.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:24.090
I had to protect you, Clark.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:26.090
protect you, Clark.

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:27.090
The whole state is watching.

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:29.090
It's not safe for you or your friends

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:31.090
