to let you sacrifice yourself.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:59.090
Your father and I made a pact.

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:02.090
Many years ago, we knew protecting you would always be dangerous,

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:06.090
