00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:15.740
I'm not going to let you go on a suicide mission for me.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:19.740
And the person who did this to you is still out there, and I'm going to find them.

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:23.720
I'm not ready to say goodbye to you, too.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:36.070
I'm just worried about you, Mrs. Kent.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.070
We all are.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.070
All of them really want.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.070
to come too, but I was afraid he'd get recognized.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.070
Oh, sorry.

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:48.070
You know, who would have thought there would have been a day

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:50.070
