00:10:50.070 --> 00:10:52.070
It's nothing new.

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:55.070
A long time ago, Jonathan and I realized

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:57.070
Clark wasn't just our blessing.

00:10:57.070 --> 00:11:00.070
Someday we'd have to share him with the world.

