Until I met you.

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:56.200
You really taught me what it meant to take care of the people that I love.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:12:01.200
And as Clark's oldest friend, I can't think of anyone better to watch over him.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:24.500
Protesters and supporters in the wake of the attempt on Senator Pence's life.

