00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:56.659
Hi.

00:13:56.659 --> 00:13:57.659
Oh.

00:13:57.659 --> 00:13:59.659
Let me get that for you.

00:13:59.659 --> 00:14:02.159
Thank you.

00:14:02.159 --> 00:14:04.159
I see you been baking again.

00:14:04.159 --> 00:14:07.159
Yeah, I'm getting a little better.

00:14:07.159 --> 00:14:09.159
